  "worked_solution": "We use the central difference approximation\n\n$$\n{f}^{\u2032}(x)\u2248\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x-h)}{2h},\n$$\n\nat the point $x=6$ with step size $h=3.$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{\u2032}(6) & \u2248\\frac{f(6+3)-f(6-3)}{2(3)} \\\\  & =\\frac{f(9)-f(3)}{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{3-6}{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{(-3)}{6} \\\\  & =-0.5.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
